## Induction Heating sample: torus inductor with source/sink terminals
## Required labels: source, sink (sidesets on terminal faces)
## Optional labels: workpiece, air
##
## Usage: Solve -> Radia-NGSolve -> Induction Heating

reset

# Create torus coil (R_major=0.11m, R_minor=0.01m)
create torus major radius 0.11 minor radius 0.01

# Cut to create terminal faces (source and sink)
webcut volume 1 with plane yplane offset 0 noimprint nomerge

# Mesh
volume all scheme tetmesh
volume all size auto factor 5
mesh volume all

# Imprint and merge after meshing
imprint volume all
merge volume all

# Material blocks
block 1 add volume all
block 1 name "coil"

# Source/sink terminal faces (created by webcut)
# The cut creates 2 new planar surfaces
sideset 1 add surface 2
sideset 1 name "source"
sideset 2 add surface 5
sideset 2 name "sink"
